capabilities.description:
Connected to {server} as {username}, workspace {workspace}.

Supported features:
- Instance status: {health}
- Detailed system diagnostics: {detailed_health}
- Workers: {workers}
- Jobs: {runs}
- Script discovery: {script_discovery}
- Flow discovery: {flow_discovery}
- Update detection: {update_visibility}

The status `unauthorized` means the token is missing a required permission. `unsupported` means the Windmill instance does not provide the required endpoint. Only the affected feature remains unavailable. Setup does not test running scripts or flows because doing so would start a job.
